2026-07-27T10:39:40.4538967Z i /tmp/Rtmpza80fB/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:39:40.4539435Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:39:40.4539878Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:39:40.4540504Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:39:40.4541161Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:39:40.4542038Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:39:40.4542908Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
